  "body": "Enjoy the best of both worlds with this appealing Long Bay property, offering a taste of the Coatesville lifestyle without leaving the convenience of the North Shore behind. Built by Sentinel Homes and surrounded by peaceful bushland, this single-level home offers an easy, relaxed way of living, with space to unwind and enjoy the surroundings.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n- Built by Sentinel Homes with easy single-level living and two separate lounges.\r\n- Heated swimming pool overlooking peaceful bushland.\r\n- 20 solar panels, 8kW inverter, 16kWh battery storage and EV charging.\r\n- Central heating for year-round comfort.\r\n- Three-car garaging, ample storage and workshop space.\r\n\r\nDesigned for family living, the home features two separate lounge areas providing flexibility and room for everyone, while central heating ensures year-round comfort. Outside, a heated swimming pool takes centre stage, overlooking the tranquil bush setting and creating the perfect spot for summer entertaining or simply unwinding at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nAdding to the home's appeal is an impressive solar setup, featuring 20 solar panels, an 8kW inverter, 16kWh battery storage and convenient electric vehicle charging in the garage. Three-car garaging, additional storage and workshop potential add further practicality, while the private driveway enhances the sense of peace and seclusion.\r\n\r\nDespite its peaceful, semi-rural feel, you're remarkably close to everything. Long Bay Beach is just seven minutes away, Long Bay College two minutes, State Highway 1 five minutes and Westfield Albany approximately seven minutes by car.\r\n\r\nWith excellent schooling, beautiful beaches, parks and everyday amenities all close by, this is a unique opportunity to enjoy a country-style lifestyle in a highly convenient North Shore location.",
